Audit record for pypy/module/_metatensor/rule_leave.py

The leave rule may use only the vocabulary in
pypy/module/_metatensor/motion_iface.py. It must not import or name the
fused representation, the resume data or any kernel detail.

benchmark/eval/audit_rules.py checks this. It reads the rule's imports and
the names it uses, and prints them.

    python3 benchmark/eval/audit_rules.py pypy/module/_metatensor/rule_leave.py

This passes. The rule imports only pypy.module._metatensor.motion_iface.

    python3 benchmark/eval/audit_rules.py benchmark/motion/rule_leave_leaky.py

This fails with a non-zero exit status. rule_leave_leaky.py is a copy of the
rule that reaches past motion_iface, and the audit rejects it.
